  "body": "**Blocked by:** #621, #642, #647, #651, #696\n\n## Context\n\nReview follow-up harvested in #728, from PR #325: `backend/packages/ai-gateway/package.json:14` lists `pg` under `dependencies`, but the package only imports types from it (`import type { Pool, PoolClient } from \"pg\"` in `src/gateway.ts:1` and `src/__tests__/gateway.test.ts:2`), which are erased at compile time; `Pool`/`PoolClient` objects always come from the caller. `@types/pg` is already a dev dependency.\n\nRemoving the dependency changes `backend/pnpm-lock.yaml`, which #621, #642, #647, #651 and #696 also edit.\n\n## Task\n\nRemove `pg` from `dependencies` in `backend/packages/ai-gateway/package.json` and regenerate `backend/pnpm-lock.yaml` with `pnpm install`.\n\n## Touches\n\n- backend/packages/ai-gateway/package.json\n- backend/pnpm-lock.yaml\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- The dependency removal and the lockfile update.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- Dependencies of any other package.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- `backend/packages/ai-gateway/package.json` has no `pg` entry under `dependencies` and keeps `@types/pg` under `devDependencies`.\n- `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` succeeds in `backend/`, and `pnpm run verify` passes.\n\n\n<!-- crb-followup:v1 pr=325 key=850068ad12 -->",
